1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,242
The press cycle had its own gravity.

2
00:00:02,242 --> 00:00:11,134
In debut interviews she was asked, inevitably, about the nickname — little Jennie, the comparison to the label's most famous all-rounder.

3
00:00:11,134 --> 00:00:16,649
Her answer became the most quoted sentence of her first year: that she hoped to find her own color.

4
00:00:16,649 --> 00:00:18,170
It is a small sentence.

5
00:00:18,170 --> 00:00:21,069
It is also the entire plot of what came next.

